Jenkins
1. What is Jenkins?
Jenkins is an open-source automation server used in DevOps.
It automates tasks like:
•	Fetching source code from GitHub.
•	Compiling the code.
•	Running the program.
•	Checking whether the build was successful or failed.
This process is part of CI/CD (Continuous Integration and Continuous Delivery/Deployment).
